Meta.documentation:String.trim
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Removes whitespace from both ends of every String passing through.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator resource: leading and trailing whitespace is stripped,
Meta.documentation:interior whitespace is untouched.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all — each input String
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default — the trimmed result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:String:%20%20Hello%20%20>>String.trim:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:Hello
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see String.upper String.lower
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0Afunction%20trim()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22trim%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DtrimProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20trimProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_String_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_String_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09return%20this%3F.out_String_default%3F.(%7Bvalue%3Ainput.value.trim()%7D)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Atrim.Processor%3DtrimProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dtrim%3B]>>NewResource:String.trim
